<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first</p>
<p>division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>13 - Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes)</p>
<p>11 - David Zitelli (Strasbourg)</p>
<p>9 - Miladin Becanovic (Lille), Alain Caveglia (Lyon), Anderson</p>
<p>(Monaco), Japhet N'Doram (Nantes)</p>
<p>8 - Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux), Anton Drobnjak (Bastia),</p>
<p>Thierry Henry (Monaco)</p>
<p>7 - Leonardo, Julio Cesar Dely Valdes (both Paris St-Germain)</p>
<p>6 - Patrice Loko (Paris Saint-Germain), Moussa Saib (Auxerre),</p>
<p>Victor Ikpeba (Monaco), Christopher Wreh (Guingamp)</p>
</text>
